id: pm-rl-hjg1
title: Persisted bounded recursive self-improvement loop (pm rl loop run)
description: "Execute the collect -> train -> evaluate -> compare -> promote-or-reject cycle as a persisted pm-rl command: every generation records a collection Run with merge-safe metric notes and a Generation item, promotion goes through the existing transactional, budget-checked gate, refusal reasons are recorded as item history, and evaluation results deterministically derive the next generation's training and evaluation configuration. Hard bounds: max generations, total sample budget, regression guard, no promotion without a strictly better held-out evaluation. Uses the deterministic built-in contextual bandit as the trainer so the loop runs end to end in tests and a manual CLI demo."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[3]: execution,recursive-training,roadmap
created_at: "2026-10-04T16:30:51.567Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-04T18:18:30.835Z"
author: pi-glm
estimated_minutes: 480
acceptance_criteria: "pm rl loop run executes a bounded multi-generation loop end to end against a real tracker and promotes only via the existing transactional promotion flow; Each generation leaves a collection Run item with per-sample metric notes and a Generation item; refusal reasons are recorded in item history; The next generation's learning rate and evaluation sample count are derived deterministically from the previous evaluation results; Generation limit, sample budget, unchanged checkpoint, widening gap, statistical gate refusal and approval budget exhaustion all stop the loop with a distinct recorded reason; Two loops run concurrently on two real Git branches merge losslessly: all items and metric notes survive in both directions"
parent: pm-rl-apvf
comments[11]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-04T16:30:56.440Z",pi-glm,"Starting the persisted loop slice. Plan: (1) extract the bandit adapter's single-generation step (collection observations, REINFORCE update, held-out means, gate verdict) so the persisted controller reuses one numerical kernel; (2) add a pure loop module (config parsing with hard bounds, deterministic next-config derivation from evaluation results, promotion score builders, metric-event builders); (3) refactor registerEnvironment/registerGeneration/promoteGeneration/startRun into reusable cores; (4) expose runRlLoop as a typed SDK function plus the pm rl loop run command; (5) end-to-end tests incl. two-branch lossless merge; (6) manual CLI demo in a scratch pm project."
  "2026-10-04T17:25:06.627Z",codex-sol,"Resuming as codex-sol: review inherited implementation, add failing-first deterministic and concurrency regressions, verify packed scratch CLI and full release gates, then commit and open one PR. Keep this feature and the larger epic open."
  "2026-10-04T17:28:53.886Z",codex-sol,"Failing-first evidence: inherited 19 loop tests passed; added tests failed for missing persisted budget/generation stop and seed configuration. Deterministic seed 2, ten held-out episodes, confidence 0.001 produced a sampled 0.9 vs 0.4 win despite true reward regression 0.469277 vs 0.5, and the inherited loop promoted it. Added exact expected held-out reward guard alongside Hoeffding gate, full seed configuration and terminal report comment. Replacing sequential branch test with simultaneous Git worktree loops and both-direction byte-exact history verification; replacing Proxy fault injection with real ENOTDIR journal failure."
  "2026-10-04T17:36:47.897Z",codex-sol,"Verification update: 25/25 focused loop tests passed through pm test in snapshot workspace with pm_context_mode=none. Includes real simultaneous worktrees, independent merge directions, exact metrics, byte-preserved JSONL histories, history verification, shared-approval serialization and lucky-sample regression. Source/none was refused by the runner and isolated mode lacks project sources; snapshot resolves the execution contract. Initial full gate had all 357 tests pass but invalid coverage because sources changed during the run; rerunning the complete release gate with source now frozen. Changelog check is current, so no regeneration. Packed scratch CLI completed three promotions and 768 samples; corrected README activation to explicit local project package path."
  "2026-10-04T17:39:24.974Z",codex-sol,"Persisted the focused test linkage with pm_context_mode=none and workspace_context_mode=snapshot, replacing the original context-incomplete link. The plain pm test pm-rl-hjg1 --run --progress invocation now uses the verified snapshot contract."
  "2026-10-04T17:40:10.407Z",codex-sol,"Final frozen-source npm run release:check passed: 357/357 tests, zero failures/skips; coverage-gate reports all 21 authored source files with lines/branches/functions/statements 100.00%; docstring-gate documents 147 declarations. Typecheck/build/lint/zero-duplication/attestation/identity audit/production audit (0 vulnerabilities)/pack dry-run/changelog check passed. CHANGELOG was already current and was not regenerated. Final packed scratch CLI demo promoted three generations (held-out means 0.523175, 0.549825, 0.57255), consumed 768/768 samples and stopped at generation_limit; seed history strict verification passed. Complete exact output and gates are in docs/recursive-loop-validation.md. Durable Compose/LLM controller remains in open epic pm-rl-apvf."
  "2026-10-04T17:58:35.121Z",codex-sol,"Concurrency repair for PR #61: first add a deterministic regression using real SDK create ordering, observe failure, then make content-addressed registration recover only typed already-exists collisions with matching digest. Audit loop seed, run, and generation creates; preserve typed conflicts and all 100% coverage thresholds. Verify 20 repeats and release:check before explicit-path commit/push."
  "2026-10-04T18:02:52.135Z",codex-sol,"Failing-first on Node v26.7.0: node --test --test-name-pattern=\"two simultaneous loops share\" test/loop.test.ts deterministically failed (pass 0, fail 1), with Item \"rl-env-loop-bandit-1-e0ddf819a87f\" already exists. Real SDK create barrier makes both reads finish before either create. Additional injected real creates failed for seed and mismatching content. After implementation all 3 focused regression tests passed. Pinned SDK 2026.10.4 duplicate-create error has conflict exit 4 and empty context; recovery checks its exact resolved-id message and revalidates actual content as well as claimed hashes."
  "2026-10-04T18:05:29.264Z",codex-sol,"20/20 deterministic concurrency repetitions passed on Node v26.7.0: for iteration in $(seq 1 20); do node --test --test-name-pattern=\"two simultaneous loops share\" test/loop.test.ts; done. Linked focused test also passed through pm test --run --only-last --progress with pm_context_mode=none and workspace_context_mode=snapshot (5 tests, 5 pass, 0 fail). The first linked-run context refusal was corrected by recording snapshot isolation; no tracker sandbox bypass was used. Audit: loop.ts is pure; loop environment, seed, collection Run, and candidate Generation persistence all route through validated collision recovery."
  "2026-10-04T18:11:39.312Z",codex-sol,"Audit preserved the existing no-rerun contract: seed registration can return matching provenance without mutation, but loop execution refuses created=false with typed loop_already_started before collecting. A deterministic same-id seed-create barrier verifies one loop owner, one rejection and one Run. The inherited rerun test remains unchanged and passes. Added real SDK strict-duplicate and invalid-status failures, a different-id duplicate, and a real EACCES filesystem failure to ensure collision recovery propagates unrelated errors. Starting final unchanged-source release:check and 20 repetitions."
  "2026-10-04T18:18:30.135Z",codex-sol,"Final verification on Node v26.7.0: npm run release:check exited 0, 364/364 tests, 0 fail, 0 skipped; coverage-gate: 21 source file(s) reported, thresholds met (lines 100.00%, branches 100.00%, functions 100.00%, statements 100.00%). No duplicates found; Found 0 clones; docstring-gate: 21 file(s), 149 declaration(s) documented; every publish invocation is attested; git identity audit approved 4 unique address(es); found 0 vulnerabilities; changelog is up to date. Final unchanged-source deterministic race repeated 20/20 PASS. Plain pm test pm-rl-hjg1 --run --progress passed both linked snapshot commands (32/32 complete loop suite; 9/9 focused regressions). Failing-first output, root cause, implementation boundaries and exact gate lines recorded in docs/recursive-loop-validation.md. CHANGELOG was not regenerated. Scoped work complete; release claim but leave item in_progress. Push PR #61 branch only; no review-thread replies or merge."
